# ⚖️ Traditional Loop vs Comprehension

| Traditional Loop | Comprehension |
|------------------|---------------|
| More lines of code | Fewer lines of code |
| Easy for complex logic | Best for simple transformations |
| May require temporary variables | Concise and readable |
| Slightly more verbose | More Pythonic |

